  "releaseNotes": "v3.0.7 - AccountId Parameter\n- Added optional AccountId parameter to LogDBLoggerOptions\n- AccountId can be specified directly or resolved from API key\n\nv3.0.6 - gRPC Reader Update\n- Updated gRPC reader service integration\n- Now uses shared repository pattern for multi-tenant support\n- Improved error handling and logging\n\nv3.0.3 - Maintenance Release\n- Package dependency updates\n- Stability improvements\n\nv3.0.0 - Major Update\n- NEW: ILogDBReader for querying logs\n- NEW: Fluent query builders (QueryLogs, QueryCache, QueryLogPoints, QueryRelations)\n- NEW: Time series and statistics APIs\n- NEW: Graph traversal for relations\n- Enhanced: Compression support for large responses",
